        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 2.01 The Employer recognizes the Union as the exclusive representative of all of its employees performing the work within the jurisdiction of the Union for the purpose of collective bargaining, with respect to rates of pay, hours of work and other conditions of employment. Any and all employees shall receive at least the minimum wages and work under the conditions of this Agreement.",
